        <!-- Key Security Points -->
        <mxCell id="security-note" value="🔒 SECURITY ARCHITECTURE HIGHLIGHTS&#xa;&#xa;1. All external traffic encrypted with TLS 1.3&#xa;2. Agent authentication via mTLS certificates (not passwords)&#xa;3. Student authentication via JWT (Bearer tokens)&#xa;4. Database and Redis only accessible from internal network&#xa;5. Containers isolated with resource limits and dropped capabilities&#xa;6. No direct Docker API exposure to students&#xa;7. Firewall allows only ports 443 and 22 (admin SSH)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
